{"title":"Career Roadmap · Claims Executive","role":"Claims Executive","summary":"A Claims Executive handles the operational processing of insurance claims, including claim registration, document verification, policy/coverage checks, coordination with customers and insurers/TPAs, query resolution, settlement tracking, and claims reporting.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Banking & Insurance"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"Claims Executive is generally an entry-level role, unlike Claims Manager. Graduates can enter directly after a relevant BBA if they understand insurance fundamentals, documentation, Excel, communication, and claims workflows."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What changes"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Insurance foundations"},{"text":"Banking, insurance, risk, accounting"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Claims operations"},{"text":"Registration, documentation, verification"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Claims analysis"},{"text":"Complex cases, queries, quality and reporting"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Claims supervision"},{"text":"Team management, fraud awareness, compliance"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Claims management"},{"text":"Portfolio, process improvement, insurer operations"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Digital claims leadership"},{"text":"AI, automation, predictive claims and risk intelligence"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Finance & insurance foundations"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, banking"},{"text":"Insurance case study"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Insurance operations"},{"text":"Policy, claims, documentation"},{"text":"Insurance internship"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Claims processing"},{"text":"Verification, Excel, reporting"},{"text":"Claims workflow project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Analytics & risk"},{"text":"SQL, Power BI, fraud concepts"},{"text":"Claims analytics project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Banking & Insurance Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Banking Fundamentals"},{"text":"Insurance Fundamentals"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Financial Markets"},{"text":"Risk Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the insurance ecosystem"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Company"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Claim"},{"type":"h","text":"Claims Team / TPA / Surveyor / Other specialists"},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement / Repudiation / Further query"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact workflow differs between insurance products and insurers."},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insured"},{"text":"Insurer"},{"text":"Policyholder"},{"text":"Premium"},{"text":"Sum insured"},{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Exclusion"},{"text":"Deductible"},{"text":"Co-payment"},{"text":"Waiting period"},{"text":"Policy period"},{"text":"Endorsement"},{"text":"Claim"},{"text":"Claim settlement"},{"text":"Nominee"},{"text":"Beneficiary"},{"text":"Renewal"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Major insurance categories"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the differences between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health insurance"},{"text":"Motor insurance"},{"text":"Life insurance"},{"text":"Property insurance"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Commercial insurance"},{"text":"Liability insurance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an undergraduate aiming at claims operations, health and motor claims are useful starting areas because of their large operational volume."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Claims Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the general claims lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 1 — Claim Intimation"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer or authorised party reports the claim."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 2 — Claim Registration"},{"type":"p","text":"Claim details are recorded in the system."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 3 — Document Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"Required documents are collected."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 4 — Policy Verification"},{"type":"p","text":"Check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy validity"},{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Applicable limits"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Deductibles"},{"text":"Claim conditions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 5 — Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the insurance product, this may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claims examiner"},{"text":"Surveyor"},{"text":"Investigator"},{"text":"Medical reviewer"},{"text":"Specialist assessor"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 6 — Decision"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible outcomes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Approved"},{"text":"Partially approved"},{"text":"Rejected/repudiated"},{"text":"Additional information required"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 7 — Settlement"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligible claim amount is processed according to policy terms."},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim forms"},{"text":"Policy documents"},{"text":"Customer identity documents"},{"text":"Bills/invoices"},{"text":"Receipts"},{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Discharge documents"},{"text":"Repair estimates"},{"text":"Investigation documents"},{"text":"Bank details"},{"text":"Supporting correspondence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact documents vary by insurance product and claim."},{"type":"h","text":"Core professional skill"},{"type":"p","text":"Never assume that a document is valid simply because it exists."},{"type":"p","text":"Check:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Completeness","consistency","relevance","policy applicability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Become Claims-Job Ready"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim registration"},{"text":"Document verification"},{"text":"Policy checking"},{"text":"Claims correspondence"},{"text":"Query management"},{"text":"Customer communication"},{"text":"Settlement tracking"},{"text":"Claims escalation"},{"text":"MIS reporting"},{"text":"Turnaround-time monitoring"},{"text":"Quality checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Claims KPIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Claim frequency"},{"type":"p","text":"How often claims occur relative to the relevant exposure/policy base."},{"type":"h","text":"Claim severity"},{"type":"p","text":"Average cost/value associated with claims."},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement ratio"},{"type":"p","text":"A commonly used claims metric, but its exact definition can differ by context and reporting methodology."},{"type":"h","text":"TAT"},{"type":"h","text":"Turnaround Time"},{"type":"p","text":"Measures how long a claim takes to move through a process."},{"type":"h","text":"Pending claims"},{"type":"p","text":"Claims awaiting action, documentation, assessment, or decision."},{"type":"h","text":"Rejection/repudiation rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Measures claims not accepted under applicable policy terms."},{"type":"h","text":"Query rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Measures claims requiring additional information or clarification."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Analytics, Risk & Fraud Awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claims analytics"},{"text":"Fraud indicators"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Claims quality assurance"},{"text":"Regulatory awareness"},{"text":"Process auditing"},{"text":"Customer grievance handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"CTE"},{"type":"p","text":"Window Functions"},{"type":"p","text":"Aggregations"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claims dashboard"},{"text":"Settlement dashboard"},{"text":"Pending-claims dashboard"},{"text":"TAT dashboard"},{"text":"Product-wise claims dashboard"},{"text":"Region-wise claims dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fraud Awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"A Claims Executive should understand potential warning indicators such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inconsistent documentation"},{"text":"Suspicious timing"},{"text":"Duplicate claims"},{"text":"Unusual claim patterns"},{"text":"Inconsistent customer information"},{"text":"Unexplained discrepancies"},{"text":"Repeated high-frequency claims"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"A claims executive should identify and escalate potential red flags, not independently accuse a customer of fraud without proper investigation and organisational procedures."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Health Claims"},{"text":"Medical documents, hospital bills, policy coverage"}],[{"text":"Motor Claims"},{"text":"Vehicle damage, repair estimates, surveyor coordination"}],[{"text":"Life Claims"},{"text":"Policy documents, nominee verification, death claims"}],[{"text":"Property Claims"},{"text":"Property damage, loss assessment"}],[{"text":"Travel Claims"},{"text":